      "answer": 0,
      "explain": "Bits can skew on separate 2-FF paths.",
      "difficulty": "easy"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdc_easy_04",
      "type": "true_false",
      "prompt": "Never fan q1 into combinational logic in the dst domain.",
